the car is currently connecting to VGU_Student_guest.
to access the pi.
  1.install RealVNC-viewer
  2.sign up -> sign in
  3.enter the CURRENT IP address of the pi (have not set a static IP).
      connect to the same wifi
      ping raspberrypi.local
      if cannot, reset the pi or turn off/on the wifi on your lap
  4.set up your own username&pass

to change the wifi.
simply access through VNC and change on the taskbar
